{
  // Hideout crafts observed in-game but NOT served by tarkov.dev.
  //
  // tarkov.dev's craft list is stale relative to the current game: it serves
  // the same crafts for `regular` and `pvp-season` and is missing the recipes
  // below (verified in-game). Several are patch 1.1.0.0 content - notably the
  // Black Division decryption chain in the Intelligence Center - but they live
  // in the shared game data (both modes), so this is a base addition, not mode-
  // specific. Entries use tarkov.dev's craft shape (station/level/duration/
  // requiredItems/productItem) with tarkov.dev ids, so they can be adopted
  // directly.
  //
  // taskUnlock: the id of the task that unlocks the craft. Present as null on
  // quest-gated crafts whose unlocking task id is not in the capture - fill it
  // in (or let tarkov.dev resolve it) when known. Absent on crafts with no task
  // unlock, matching how tarkov.dev omits it. requiredQuestItems/gameEditions
  // are [] like the served shape.
  //
  // Excluded: 17 Christmas Tree (event station, areaType 21) recipes -
  // that station is not modeled by tarkov.dev or the capture, and the event is
  // not active; they are omitted rather than shipped with a null station.
  //
  // Source: verified in-game (Seasonal Character hideout production screens).
  // Proof: EFT patch 1.1.0.0 (Seasonal Character / Black Division), 2026-08-03.
  //   https://steamdb.info/patchnotes/24536010/

